{"key": {"text": "Number ten. Italy. With a Global Firepower score of 0.2211, a defense budget of $48.1 billion, and 714 aircraft. Italy runs two aircraft carriers, the Cavour and the Trieste, both able to fly F-35 jets. And at Cameri, in northern Italy, it hosts the only F-35 final assembly line in Europe. Its navy is one of the strongest in the Mediterranean, and Italian companies build their own frigates, helicopters and submarines. Italy's famous Carabinieri, its military police, are part of the armed forces too, and Italian troops serve on NATO missions from the Baltic to the Balkans.", "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural", "rate": "-6%", "pitch": "+0Hz"}, "words": [{"w": "Number", "t": 0.106, "d": 0.239}, {"w": "ten.", "t": 0.359, "d": 0.332}, {"w": "Italy.", "t": 1.13, "d": 0.372}, {"w": "With", "t": 1.955, "d": 0.106}, {"w": "a", "t": 2.074, "d": 0.067}, {"w": "Global", "t": 2.154, "d": 0.426}, {"w": "Firepower", "t": 2.593, "d": 0.638}, {"w": "score", "t": 3.245, "d": 0.412}, {"w": "of", "t": 3.67, "d": 0.12}, {"w": "0.2211,", "t": 3.803, "d": 2.008}, {"w": "a", "t": 6.223, "d": 0.04}, {"w": "defense", "t": 6.277, "d": 0.386}, {"w": "budget", "t": 6.676, "d": 0.346}, {"w": "of", "t": 7.035, "d": 0.08}, {"w": "$48.1 billion,", "t": 7.128, "d": 2.168}, {"w": "and", "t": 9.574, "d": 0.12}, {"w": "714", "t": 9.707, "d": 1.037}, {"w": "aircraft.", "t": 10.758, "d": 0.598}, {"w": "Italy", "t": 11.795, "d": 0.306}, {"w": "runs", "t": 12.114, "d": 0.386}, {"w": "two", "t": 12.513, "d": 0.293}, {"w": "aircraft", "t": 12.819, "d": 0.532}, {"w": "carriers,", "t": 13.364, "d": 0.638}, {"w": "the", "t": 14.202, "d": 0.106}, {"w": "Cavour", "t": 14.322, "d": 0.652}, {"w": "and", "t": 15.066, "d": 0.067}, {"w": "the", "t": 15.146, "d": 0.067}, {"w": "Trieste,", "t": 15.226, "d": 0.771}, {"w": "both", "t": 16.277, "d": 0.319}, {"w": "able", "t": 16.662, "d": 0.306}, {"w": "to", "t": 16.981, "d": 0.093}, {"w": "fly", "t": 17.088, "d": 0.439}, {"w": "F-35", "t": 17.54, "d": 1.237},